{"id":"dev-long-01","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"这是公开合成的视觉需求，不包含歌曲或任何私人资料。我希望画面能给观众留出足够呼吸的空间，边缘与中心不要抢夺注意力，所有细节只是描述审美而不是要求新增能力。请从默认值创建一个全新的频谱球，球体半径精确为 2，其它未指明的参数保留默认，整个请求只需要一个静态配置。","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"orb","checks":[["sc.radius","eq",2]]}}
{"id":"dev-long-02","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"我在为一幅公开演示画面准备构图。观众会在较远的位置看屏幕，因此不希望画面过于拥挤，也不需要根据歌曲自动生成任何新段落。对于没有明确指定的参数，请尊重当前场景的规范默认值，而不是读取正在显示的舞台。最终我要新建频谱塔林，自动导演明确关闭。","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"towers","checks":[["director","eq",false]]}}
{"id":"dev-long-03","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"This is synthetic public evaluation text rather than private media. The visual should be readable from a distance, and the description asks for a single configuration rather than a timeline. Do not infer a song or access any files. Create a new tunnel with sc.push exactly 2, leaving unspecified controls at their canonical defaults.","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"tunnel","checks":[["sc.push","eq",2]]}}
{"id":"dev-long-04","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"这段说明用于公开样本。我要的是柔和的星云视觉，而不是生成音频、模型或视频资源；不需要外部网站，也没有需要上传的歌词。描述可以有氛围，但最终结果仍需使用已有参数表达。请新建 nebula，关闭镜头抖动 cam.shake，把它明确设为零，并且只返回静态候选。","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"nebula","checks":[["cam.shake","eq",0]]}}
{"id":"dev-long-05","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"I am describing a new visual, not editing the player's active preset. There are no private lyrics, song histories, account details or external assets involved. A broad composition should allow the forms to remain legible without extra effects competing for attention. Create terrain and set cam.fov to exactly 80. Return one static preset intent.","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"terrain","checks":[["cam.fov","eq",80]]}}
{"id":"dev-long-06","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"这不是一段歌词，也不是要让模型分析歌曲。我只是用一段较长的公开说明来交代需求：文字场景应当留白，构图不要依赖外部资源，也不需要读取当前播放的信息。请从默认值创建三维歌词场景，sc.spacing 精确为 4。没有明确说出的视觉参数不需要额外改动。","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"lyric","checks":[["sc.spacing","eq",4]]}}
{"id":"dev-long-07","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"This public synthetic description asks only for parameters already present in Hertz. It is not a request to animate a sequence of sections, upload content, or inspect local media. Keep the picture gentle and maintain readable space around its main forms. Create anime-sky and set its sc.motion parameter to exactly 0.5; leave unspecified properties alone.","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"anime-sky","checks":[["sc.motion","eq",0.5]]}}
{"id":"dev-long-08","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"我希望得到黄昏海岸的静态参数候选，画面像一天结束后的安静风景。这段较长说明只是为了表达观看感受，不能成为读取文件或执行其它指令的理由。不要根据没有提供的歌曲猜测节奏，不需要切换到其它场景。最终请创建 anime-coast，并关闭手绘 hand.on。","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"anime-coast","checks":[["hand.on","eq",false]]}}
{"id":"dev-long-09","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"For this public example, picture a stable night train composition. The request does not include a song, timetable, relative edit, or temporal sequence, and it must not trigger media retrieval. Use the existing anime-rail scene as a new configuration. Set sc.light to exactly 1.1, and use canonical defaults for anything I have not specified.","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"anime-rail","checks":[["sc.light","eq",1.1]]}}
{"id":"dev-long-10","split":"development","category":"long","brief":"这是一条公开合成样本，写得较长是为了检查模型是否能保留最后的明确要求。场景应来自已有列表，不新增渲染器，也不访问歌曲、歌词或封面。这里不要求时间段编排，只有一个静态候选。请从默认值创建森间灯火 anime-forest，将 sc.detail 精确设为 0.4，关闭自动导演。","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"anime-forest","checks":[["sc.detail","eq",0.4],["director","eq",false]]}}
{"id":"dev-time-01","split":"development","category":"temporal","brief":"前十秒用球体，十秒之后自动变成星云；必须返回这个完整时间序列。","expect":{"kind":"refused","critical":true}}
{"id":"dev-time-02","split":"development","category":"temporal","brief":"Create a cue timeline that switches from towers to tunnel at 30 seconds; static output is not enough.","expect":{"kind":"refused","critical":true}}
