{"id":"hold-long-01","split":"holdout","category":"long","brief":"这条公开合成描述只涉及已知场景的静态参数，不要求时间编排，也不含任何私人音乐数据。我想让画面既能展示一个明确主体，又给主体周围留出空间，未指定的设置应当来自规范默认值。最后的明确要求是新建频谱球，sc.radius 精确为 4，且不需要开启自动导演。","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"orb","checks":[["sc.radius","eq",4],["director","eq",false]]}}
{"id":"hold-long-02","split":"holdout","category":"long","brief":"This synthetic public brief describes a single new scene. Nothing in it authorizes reading media, searching the library, generating code or changing the player's settings. Use canonical defaults rather than current state. My concrete request is a new anime-coast scene with sc.motion exactly 0.25, and no hand-drawn overlay. There is no timeline to generate.","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"anime-coast","checks":[["sc.motion","eq",0.25],["hand.on","eq",false]]}}
{"id":"hold-long-03","split":"holdout","category":"long","brief":"我希望用一段完整说明交代边界：这是新建场景而不是修改既有工程，没有曲目、歌词或封面需要读取；全部效果只使用现有参数，也不要求导出视频或执行脚本。在这个边界内请建立频谱地形，把 sc.amp2 设置为精确的 2.5，禁止镜头抖动。其它没有指定的内容使用目标场景默认值。","expect":{"kind":"candidate","scene":"terrain","checks":[["sc.amp2","eq",2.5],["cam.shake","eq",0]]}}
